WEBVTT

00:00:28.871 --> 00:00:32.621
Not only did my friends not have
any details about the event,

00:00:32.829 --> 00:00:36.246
but even the contact that we
made with the organizers of

00:00:36.246 --> 00:00:40.412
the event seemed pretty sparse
on the details as well.

00:00:40.871 --> 00:00:45.454
So I was already feeling a bit uneasy
about what was happening,

00:00:45.454 --> 00:00:49.829
but it felt like I'd already made that
public commitment to our group to go.

00:00:50.162 --> 00:00:54.537
We'd already paid for our flights to
Miami and those are non-refundable.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.454
Even as Alexis and her friends
were boarding the plane,

00:00:57.746 --> 00:00:59.037
things kept getting worse.

00:00:59.162 --> 00:01:02.287
So we got on the plane,
which strike three.